## Scope

### In

- `tests/unit/**`, `tests/integration/**`
- Provably duplicate **test functions** (ownership table)
- Inline `generate_exhaustive_sample_genes` → existing module fixtures
- Parametrize / small helpers (e.g. `source_object` coverage)
- `--durations` on fast + slow slices; extend `_SLOW_MODULE_SUFFIXES` when justified
- Baseline timings in [`2026-05-21-test-suite-speed-baseline.md`](../plans/2026-05-21-test-suite-speed-baseline.md)

### Out

- Vitest / frontend tests
- Production behavior changes
- Aggressive merge of `test_sample_gene_exhaustive` into a handful of opaque parametrized tests
- Deleting tests because `test_fast` missed ≤70s (use slow-tag path instead)

---

## Delete vs consolidate vs keep

| Action | When |
|--------|------|
| **Delete** | Canonical owner already proves the same invariant; row added to ownership **Removed in D1** |
| **Parametrize / fixture** | Same invariant, duplicated boilerplate only |
| **Keep** | Distinct failure mode, DB mutation, empty-DB precondition, or domain-specific re-import |
| **Never slim** | Tests that only assert import succeeded with no contract; implementation-line-number names |

